        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, ash coffee ground pellets, to landfarming</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, ash coffee ground pellets, to landfarming
Ash composition data completed with the ecoinvent inventory of "disposal, wood ash mixture, pure, 0% water, to landfarming";
UUID: bdbcef84-51bd-4dc4-b3e3-8f56513c25fc
This data set describes the disposal of the ash, only spreading of the ash is included (no transport)
Location: The inventory is modelled for a pilot plant in Switzerland
Technology: none
Time period: Collection of data and publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: ash composition estimated with data for wood ash
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_bdbcef84-51bd-4dc4-b3e3-8f56513c25fc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
